{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John, it's been a few days since we talked. So much has gone on, both good and bad. Yesterday, when we were at the theater, Samantha loves theater, I asked her to become my girlfriend, and she agreed. We have gone through a lot in this short period. There were good and bad, but I'm happy with her. All that ups and downs were a bit overwhelming, but it's part of life. What about you? Anything interesting lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-6ab7ec4af0d09f233cf47437", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:13.760657+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6ab7ec4af0d09f233cf47437", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6ab7ec4af0d09f233cf47437", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James, this is great news! Where else have you been besides the theater? My parents just started learning coding from me - it's been a learning experience, but I'm glad to help them out. It binds us a little closer. Look at this photo, this is my father coding his own program for the first time."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-3b9efa14274faec5d9063d8b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:13.800265+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3b9efa14274faec5d9063d8b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3b9efa14274faec5d9063d8b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: That's great, John! Looks like he's having a good time in the pic. Samantha and I were also at McGee's bar. It turned out that she loves a good lager beer. She and I have so much in common!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-6c01f8bcbc34dd2460aa760f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:13.828189+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6c01f8bcbc34dd2460aa760f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6c01f8bcbc34dd2460aa760f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'm glad you finally found someone other than dogs that brings you joy. Well done, you will succeed!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-3ad469dec0075f1b546f8591", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:13.846979+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3ad469dec0075f1b546f8591", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3ad469dec0075f1b546f8591", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks, John. She and I are going to a baseball game next Sunday, want to join? I'll show you what Samantha looks like."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-3033419423b7f366af6a5308", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:13.878628+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3033419423b7f366af6a5308", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3033419423b7f366af6a5308", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah! Let's do it. It'll be a fun experience!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-7afe3c04b3ae824190c0f392", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:13.898199+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7afe3c04b3ae824190c0f392", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7afe3c04b3ae824190c0f392", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Great. Well, what else is new in your life?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-9585fd422d8111e08a7b92a6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:13.918527+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9585fd422d8111e08a7b92a6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9585fd422d8111e08a7b92a6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I bought some new gaming equipment to improve my skills. For example, new headphones."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-c27d71495b174f1ac6f30a00", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:13.936918+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c27d71495b174f1ac6f30a00", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c27d71495b174f1ac6f30a00", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Cool, which company did you choose? And what other devices did you buy?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-3379c47a3ed3a26f41f816c1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:13.966864+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3379c47a3ed3a26f41f816c1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3379c47a3ed3a26f41f816c1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I chose headphones from Sennheiser. Judging by the reviews, they have excellent sound. Also, I bought a mouse from Logitech."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-5845297d8131e5f733eb5c4c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:13.984224+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5845297d8131e5f733eb5c4c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5845297d8131e5f733eb5c4c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Cool! I hope the new devices will improve your skill and you will play even better!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-c01e050cb0c8756d2930a40d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.008125+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c01e050cb0c8756d2930a40d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c01e050cb0c8756d2930a40d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I really hope so too. Well, do you have anything new besides the great news about you and Samantha?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-95961db92d4b422a1bd7a902", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.017621+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "95961db92d4b422a1bd7a902", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "95961db92d4b422a1bd7a902", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yes, two days ago I signed up for a cooking class. I never liked cooking, but I felt that I wanted to learn something new. At the first lesson we prepared several simple dishes. I got a great omelette the first time!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-274077eaeec2caf53466af1a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.038393+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "274077eaeec2caf53466af1a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "274077eaeec2caf53466af1a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cool! I\u2019ve never heard of your desire to cook, you surprise me! How much do these cooking courses cost and what else did you cook there?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-2a1ece3c07221684649c64d6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.060868+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a1ece3c07221684649c64d6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a1ece3c07221684649c64d6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: At only $10 per class, it's very cheap! Also, I made meringue there and they taught us how to make the dough."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-2d894f33ba24cf749d4154b4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.080054+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2d894f33ba24cf749d4154b4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2d894f33ba24cf749d4154b4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Really cheap. It's great that you are always looking for a way to improve yourself!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-32fe0f90251bdc32c7235b6a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.098758+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "32fe0f90251bdc32c7235b6a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "32fe0f90251bdc32c7235b6a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks for your support, John! I really appreciate it. I hope I can treat you to my creation once I learn a little more about cooking."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-4ff0ea043037d288a0abc046", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.118061+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4ff0ea043037d288a0abc046", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4ff0ea043037d288a0abc046", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I look forward to it, James, you can do it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-1a3eaef4f7a5688498939e57", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.136324+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1a3eaef4f7a5688498939e57", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1a3eaef4f7a5688498939e57", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Your words give me even more strength to pursue my new hobby!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-13bddc34410ed464789882ac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.152570+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "13bddc34410ed464789882ac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "13bddc34410ed464789882ac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That's why we are friends, to support each other! Well, I have to go, bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-33f4953d026e58e93d274764", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.168934+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "33f4953d026e58e93d274764", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "33f4953d026e58e93d274764", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Take care, John, bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_23-2c5e4354751db4296df0c335", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:44:14.185982+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2c5e4354751db4296df0c335", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2c5e4354751db4296df0c335", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
